✅ 3. yield() vs sleep()

| Feature                       | `yield()`                           | `sleep()`                                 |
| ----------------------------- | ----------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------- |
| Purpose                       | Suggest scheduler to switch threads | Pause current thread for a specified time |
| Static Method                 | ✅ Yes                              | ✅ Yes                                    |
| Guaranteed Delay              | ❌ No                               | ✅ Approximately yes                      |
| Thread State                  | Runnable                             | TIMED_WAITING                             |
| Releases Lock                 | ❌ No                                | ❌ No                                    |
| Throws `InterruptedException` | ❌ No                                | ✅ Yes                                   |
